<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48768" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηριόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make into a wild beast</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς πρὸς αὐτὴν ἀφικνουμένους ἡ
					Κίρκη θηριοῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Piet.</u>
					144
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1291
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>come to the full size of a beast</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὶν θηριοῦσθαι τὸν γόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					107.14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>become brutal</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηριούμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					935a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Lib.</u>
					p.25O.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἀγριότητα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.53
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of seeds,
				<i>to be infested with worms</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				5.18.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> of places,
				<i>to be infested with reptiles</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				5.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Medic.,
				<i>become malignant</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλκη ἐᾶσαι θηριωθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Char.</u>
					19.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεθηριωμένον ἕλκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					3.9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
